    "text": "While today’s cybersecurity training is built on the assumption that phishing risk is evenly distributed and anyone not sufficiently aware might fall for a scam, this assumption is flawed because phishing susceptibility is not evenly spread. 🛡️\n\n👉 Read: https://t.co/Ejx7rTzOx4 https://t.co/MNBQ3AixZP",
